  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "乔木博客发布 · DeepSeek Harness",
      "text": "> v0.1.3：DeepSeek Harness **0.2.2-rc.1** 兼容更新。[本次验证范围](docs/DSH-0.2.2-RC1.md)。\n\n[English](README.en.md)\n\n把 Markdown 笔记发布到自己的 Qiaomu Blog。直接使用原 Obsidian 插件的发布弹窗、分类与设置页，保留本地图片、音频、视频和远程图片转存流程。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- 标题自动从 frontmatter、一级标题、文件名依次提取，可在原发布窗口修改。\n- 获取博客分类，选择草稿或直接发布；显示上传进度、成功数量、失败原因和重试入口。\n- 标准 Markdown 图片与 Wiki 嵌入，自动上传本地图片/音频/视频到博客 R2，转存第三方图片并改写链接。\n- Markdown 工作目录、文件导入、草稿恢复、保存冲突保护与外部修改同步。\n- 原版连接设置、API Token 测试；Token 存入系统安全凭据库。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "要求 DeepSeek Harness `0.2.2-rc.1`，Node.js 24.9 或更新。\n\n从 [Releases](https://github.com/joeseesun/qiaomu-blog-publisher-dsh/releases) 下载 tgz 和 SHA256SUMS，校验后在插件管理安装，或运行：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add /absolute/path/qiaomu-blog-publisher-dsh-0.1.3.tgz\n```\n\n侧栏打开「乔木博客发布」，导入 Markdown，在设置里填写自己的博客地址和 API Token，点击「发布到博客」。默认创建草稿；选择「直接发布」会公开文章。"
    },
    {
      "section": "数据与旧配置",
      "text": "默认笔记目录为 `$DSH_HOME/qiaomu/qiaomu-blog-publisher-dsh/notes`，未设置 DSH_HOME 时为 `~/.dsh`。可用插件配置 `notesDir` 指向明确选择的笔记目录，`dataDir` 指定插件状态目录，均使用绝对路径。单篇 Markdown 上限 2 MB，附件上限 32 MB，不跟随工作目录内软链接。\n\n「导入」支持 Markdown、媒体和原博客插件 `data.json`。媒体放在 `attachments`，Markdown 中保持相应路径；完整目录可直接配置为 notesDir。导入旧配置会把 Token 迁入 macOS Keychain、Windows DPAPI 或 Linux Secret Service，新的状态 JSON 不保存 Token，原配置不会删除。Linux 需要 `secret-tool` 和 Secret Service。"
    },
    {
      "section": "数据与旧配置",
      "text": "博客须支持原 [Qiaomu Blog](https://github.com/joeseesun/qiaomu-blog-opensource) API。媒体上传失败时沿用原版行为：文章可以创建并报告失败数量，请检查文章中的媒体链接。"
    },
    {
      "section": "验证边界",
      "text": "测试覆盖原发布业务、分类、图片/音频/视频 multipart、远程图片、标题、失败响应、CAS 保存、路径与网络边界；UI 在独立 Harness profile 验收。测试内容只发送给本机 fixture，没有提交到真实博客或 R2。Windows/Linux 凭据没有对应系统实机验收。详见 [迁移记录](docs/ADAPTATION.md)。\n\n```sh\nnpm ci\nnpm run check\nnpm pack\n```\n\nMIT。原版冻结来源 `5d41358f707320c2f56016bf62327eb60d8668b8`，来源及打包依赖见 [THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES](THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md)。\n\nHarness 0.2.2-rc.1 适配与实测边界见 [兼容验证记录](docs/DSH-0.2.2-RC1.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "Qiaomu Blog Publisher for DeepSeek Harness",
      "text": "> v0.1.3: DeepSeek Harness **0.2.2-rc.1** compatibility update. [Release verification](docs/DSH-0.2.2-RC1.md).\n\n[中文](README.md)\n\nPublish Markdown to your own Qiaomu Blog using the original publisher dialog and settings UI. Local images, audio and video upload to the blog's R2 storage; remote images are downloaded and re-uploaded through the original API."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Requires Harness `0.2.2-rc.1` and Node.js 24.9+. Download the tgz and SHA256SUMS from [Releases](https://github.com/joeseesun/qiaomu-blog-publisher-dsh/releases), verify the checksum, then install in plugin management or run:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add /absolute/path/qiaomu-blog-publisher-dsh-0.1.3.tgz\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Open Qiaomu Blog Publisher, import Markdown, enter your blog URL and API token in Settings, and open the publishing dialog. Draft is the default; choosing Published makes the article public. Title priority is frontmatter, first H1, then filename. The original category, progress, success, retry and browser editing controls are retained."
    },
    {
      "section": "Workspace and migration",
      "text": "Notes default to `$DSH_HOME/qiaomu/qiaomu-blog-publisher-dsh/notes` (`~/.dsh` without DSH_HOME). Optional absolute `notesDir` and `dataDir` configuration selects the workspace and state location. Notes are limited to 2 MB, attachments to 32 MB. Child symlinks are refused, and version-aware saves protect external edits."
    },
    {
      "section": "Workspace and migration",
      "text": "Import supports Markdown, media and the original plugin's `data.json`. Imported media goes to `attachments`; retain matching relative paths or select an existing complete directory as notesDir. Tokens migrate to macOS Keychain, Windows DPAPI or Linux Secret Service, without deleting the original data. Linux requires `secret-tool` and Secret Service. State JSON stores no API token."
    },
    {
      "section": "Workspace and migration",
      "text": "Requires the original [Qiaomu Blog API](https://github.com/joeseesun/qiaomu-blog-opensource). As in the original plugin, media failures do not prevent post creation; inspect reported failures and links before publishing publicly."
    },
    {
      "section": "Validation",
      "text": "Tests exercise the original workflow through a real local HTTP fixture, covering categories, multipart images/audio/video, remote images, repeated embeds, titles, API errors, persistence conflicts and host boundaries. No real blog or R2 account received test content. Windows/Linux credential implementations have not been exercised on those operating systems. See [ADAPTATION](docs/ADAPTATION.md).\n\n```sh\nnpm ci\nnpm run check\nnpm pack\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Validation",
      "text": "MIT. Original source frozen at `5d41358f707320c2f56016bf62327eb60d8668b8`; actual bundled licenses are listed in [THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES](THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).\n\nSee the [Harness 0.2.2-rc.1 compatibility record](docs/DSH-0.2.2-RC1.md) for tested paths and limitations."
    }
